cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "epuck-remote: remote control of the e-puck 1 with a PyBullet twin"
abstract: >-
  Remote control of the e-puck 1 robot over Bluetooth with the stock
  GCtronic firmware (advanced sercom protocol), together with a PyBullet
  twin and a dependency-free mock that speak the same protocol, so that the
  same controller and logs are used in simulation and on the real robot.
  Includes calibration tools and the measured calibration of one real
  e-puck 1.
type: software
authors:
